                        "review": "Why so dim?\n\nThis game does not support borderless window, and exclusive fullscreen is broken when Windows HDR is enabled, making it appear super dim.  \n\nBecause I have an OLED screen Windows HDR is necessary or the display will be incredibly dim.  It seems the fullscreen mode in this game forces Windows HDR to be disabled causing it to appear very dim on OLED screens.",
